Hi,

We’ve shipped a major improvement to voice cloning.

You can now create an instant voice clone from up to 2 minutes of reference audio, compared with 20 seconds before.

The longer reference sample gives the model much more information about the voice, capturing a wider range of phonemes, intonation, pauses, rhythm, pacing, emphasis, emotion, and speaking style.

This results in:

• Higher voice similarity

• Greater consistency, especially across longer sentences

• Better pronunciation coverage

• More natural prosody, including rhythm, emphasis, pacing, and emotion

• Better preservation of speaking style

We’ve also improved overall voice quality in Soniox TTS v2 across both built-in and cloned voices.

